Tom: I think I''ll try basketball. I really like team games.
Mia: Basketball is great. You have to work closely with your teammates.
Tom: That''s exactly why I like it. What about you, Mia?
Mia: I want to join the swimming team. I like training on my own.
Tom: Swimming is hard work. You have to get up so early.
Mia: I know, but getting up early every day really pays off in the end.
Tom: That''s a good attitude. Good luck with it!', 'Mia 问 Tom 这学期想尝试哪项运动;Tom 想打篮球,喜欢团队比赛,因为要和队友紧密配合;Mia 想加入游泳队,喜欢独自训练;Tom 说游泳很辛苦要早起;Mia 说每天早起最终很有回报。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which sport does Tom want to try?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Basketball.","Swimming.","Tennis.","Golf."]},{"q":"Why does Tom like that sport?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It needs no practice.","He likes team games.","It is played alone.","It is the easiest sport."]},{"q":"Which sport does Mia want to join?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The swimming team.","Basketball.","Football.","Roller skating."]},{"q":"What does Mia like about her sport?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["She can play with a big team.","She likes training on her own.","She never has to train.","She can sleep late."]},{"q":"What does Mia say about getting up early?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["It is a waste of time.","It makes her slower.","It really pays off in the end.","It is too easy."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');
These three words do not only describe winning medals.
They remind every athlete to keep improving a little each day.
Training hard, staying calm and never giving up all matter.
In this spirit, taking part can be just as important as winning.', '奥林匹克的格言是''更快、更高、更强'';这三个词不仅指赢得奖牌,更提醒每位运动员每天都进步一点;刻苦训练、保持冷静、永不放弃都很重要;本着这种精神,参与有时和获胜同样重要。', 'uk_male', '[{"q":"What is the motto of the Olympic Games?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Win at any cost.","Play and rest.","Bigger and richer.","Faster, Higher, Stronger."]},{"q":"What do the three words NOT only describe?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Winning medals.","Daily training.","Staying calm.","Helping others."]},{"q":"What do the words remind athletes to do?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To rest more often.","To keep improving each day.","To buy new shoes.","To stop competing."]},{"q":"Which of these does the passage say matters?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Spending money.","Travelling far.","Never giving up.","Watching films."]},{"q":"What can be just as important as winning?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Going home early.","Buying medals.","Being the tallest.","Taking part."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');
Sara: I''d love to! Which two teams are playing?
Ben: Our city team is playing against last year''s champions.
Sara: Wow, that will be a tough game. Our team lost to them before.
Ben: Yes, but they have trained really hard since then.
Sara: Then it should be an exciting match. What time does it start?
Ben: At seven in the evening. Shall we meet at the gate at half past six?
Sara: Perfect. I''ll see you there. I really hope our team wins this time!', 'Ben 邀请 Sara 周六去看一场篮球大赛;对阵双方是本市球队和去年的冠军;Sara 说这会是一场硬仗,本队以前输过;Ben 说本队此后刻苦训练;比赛晚上七点开始,两人约六点半在门口见;Sara 希望本队这次能赢。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"When is the basketball match?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["This Saturday.","This Monday.","Next month.","This morning."]},{"q":"Who is the city team playing against?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A school team.","Last year''s champions.","A foreign team.","Their own coach."]},{"q":"What does Sara remember about the two teams?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They have never met.","They always draw.","Our team lost to them before.","Our team always wins."]},{"q":"What time will they meet at the gate?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["At seven o''clock.","At six o''clock.","At eight o''clock.","At half past six."]},{"q":"What does Sara hope for?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["That her team wins this time.","That the match is cancelled.","That it rains.","That nobody comes."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');
Many coaches thought he was too short and too thin to succeed.
But he refused to give up and kept practising every day.
His accurate shooting and self-belief soon surprised everyone.
His story shows that hard work matters more than what others think of you.', '一位著名球员小时候是在简陋的后院球场上学球的;许多教练觉得他太矮太瘦难以成功;但他拒绝放弃,每天坚持练习;他精准的投篮和自信很快让所有人吃惊;他的故事说明努力比别人怎么看你更重要。', 'uk_male', '[{"q":"Where did the player learn the game as a boy?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["In a large stadium.","On a poor backyard court.","At a famous school.","In another country."]},{"q":"What did many coaches think about him?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["That he was the tallest.","That he was already a star.","That he was too short and thin to succeed.","That he should be the coach."]},{"q":"What did he do instead of giving up?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["He changed sports.","He stopped training.","He left the team.","He kept practising every day."]},{"q":"What soon surprised everyone?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["His accurate shooting and self-belief.","His height.","His age.","His new shoes."]},{"q":"What does his story show?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Tall players always win.","Hard work matters more than others'' opinions.","Talent is the only thing that counts.","It is best to give up early."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');
Anna: I know it hurts, but you all played really well.
Leo: Maybe I should just quit the team.
Anna: Don''t say that. It is no use giving up after one loss.
Leo: But we trained so hard for this match.
Anna: And that hard work will pay off next time. One game does not decide everything.
Leo: You''re right. I shouldn''t blame myself so much.
Anna: Exactly. Keep going, and the team will only get stronger.', 'Leo 因决赛仅以两分之差落败而难过,甚至想退队;Anna 安慰他,说大家都打得很好,输一场就放弃毫无意义;并说刻苦训练下次会有回报,一场比赛决定不了一切;Leo 想通了,不再过分自责;Anna 鼓励他坚持下去,球队会越来越强。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Why does Leo feel terrible?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He missed the match.","He hurt his leg.","They lost the final by two points.","He forgot the time."]},{"q":"What does Leo say he might do?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Train harder.","Become a coach.","Change schools.","Quit the team."]},{"q":"What does Anna think about giving up after one loss?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is no use giving up.","It is a good idea.","It is necessary.","It is the only choice."]},{"q":"What does Anna say about their hard work?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It was wasted.","It will pay off next time.","It should stop now.","It changed nothing."]},{"q":"What does Anna encourage Leo to do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Blame himself more.","Leave the sport for good.","Keep going and grow stronger.","Forget about the team."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');
After a long day of study, a short run can clear your head.
Playing team games also teaches you to work well with others.
And learning to lose with a smile makes you stronger inside.
So find a sport you enjoy, and make it a part of your life.', '运动对身体和心灵都有好处;在长时间学习后,短跑能让头脑清醒;团队比赛还能教你与他人协作;学会微笑着面对失败会让内心更强大;所以找一项你喜欢的运动,让它成为生活的一部分。', 'uk_male', '[{"q":"What is sport good for, according to the passage?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only the body.","Only winning.","Only young people.","Both the body and the mind."]},{"q":"What can a short run do after a long day of study?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Clear your head.","Make you tired for a week.","Stop you sleeping.","Cost a lot of money."]},{"q":"What do team games teach you?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To play alone.","To work well with others.","To avoid others.","To stop trying."]},{"q":"What makes you stronger inside?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Always winning.","Buying medals.","Learning to lose with a smile.","Never playing."]},{"q":"What does the speaker tell you to do?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Give up all sport.","Watch sport on TV only.","Wait until you are older.","Find a sport you enjoy and keep it in your life."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U3', 'fltrp');

